        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/cuthawolf/{size}/2371_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-13T22:47:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ooooof. I'll be feeling the pain of that beating every time it rains. I botched it overall I think, but the deal was sealed when Sheriff Prat (that Pratt) came out and killed a citizen in the same turn, keeping Dawn from flipping back. Why Pratt?! WHYYYYYYY?!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Edit: Phew, squeaked it out just barely. Thought I was done when the wagon exploded near the end, but managed to hang on for the Victory. Boom. \\o/</p>",
